# Written for you by `node setup.mjs`. This file is only a reference.
#
# SECRETS AND ENDPOINTS ONLY. Everything you tune day to day — target wallets,
# trade size, fees, hold time — lives in config.json and on the /sniper page.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# WALLET — a burner. Fund it with what you can lose today and nothing else.
# This never leaves the machine. It is not readable from the web panel.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
PRIVATE_KEY=""

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# FEED — the one that decides whether this makes or loses money.
# A plain RPC websocket hands you the block AFTER it is built, so you fire one
# slot late, and one slot costs ~13.5% of an ~18% move.
#   Chainstack Yellowstone   from $49/mo
#   rpc edge Trader          from $249/mo
#   Shyft                    $199 / $349 / $649
#   Helius LaserStream       $499/mo (own SDK, not Yellowstone-compatible)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
RPC_URL=""
GRPC_URL=""
GRPC_TOKEN=""

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# RELAYS — express lanes to the validator. Send to all at once; duplicates are
# dropped by the network, so there is no downside.
#
# ASTRALANE (Iris) — plain JSON-RPC sendTransaction, so it is a drop-in.
#   Minimum tip 10,000 lamports (0.00001 SOL) for spam prevention; you will bid
#   far above that anyway. Tip accounts are REGION-SPECIFIC — use the one your
#   endpoint's docs list, not another region's.
#   API key: create an account on their portal, then ask in their Discord.
#   Endpoints (pick the region nearest your VPS):
#     https://edge.astralane.io/iris?api-key=KEY      global edge
#     http://fr.gateway.astralane.io/iris?api-key=KEY  Frankfurt (recommended)
#     http://ams.gateway.astralane.io/iris?api-key=KEY Amsterdam (recommended)
#     http://ny.gateway.astralane.io/iris?api-key=KEY  New York
#     http://la.gateway.astralane.io/iris?api-key=KEY  Los Angeles
#     http://jp.gateway.astralane.io/iris?api-key=KEY  Tokyo
#     http://sg.gateway.astralane.io/iris?api-key=KEY  Singapore
#   Tip accounts seen live on-chain (verify against the docs for your region):
#     astrazznxsGUhWShqgNtAdfrzP2G83DzcWVJDxwV9bF
#     astra4uejePWneqNaJKuFFA8oonqCE1sqF6b45kDMZm
#     astraRVUuTHjpwEVvNBeQEgwYx9w9CFyfxjYoobCZhL
#     astra9xWY93QyfG6yM8zwsKsRodscjQ2uU2HKNL5prk
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
ASTRALANE_URL=""
ASTRALANE_TIP=""

# NOZOMI (Temporal) — the other relay the target uses. Same JSON-RPC shape.
NOZOMI_URL=""
NOZOMI_TIP=""

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PANEL (optional) — poll your deployed app for settings, so you can change
# size, fees and targets from your phone without touching the server.
# SNIPER_TOKEN must match the one set on the web app.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
PANEL_URL=""
SNIPER_TOKEN=""
